			"notes": "- Added support for Minecraft 26.3 (requires Tech Reborn 6.2.1+)\n- Config files now actually work (they were previously ignored)\n- Bubble Gun changes:\n  - Can now be refilled by aiming at a water source, like a bucket\n  - The water slot now accepts any water container (buckets, Tech Reborn cells, other mods' containers)\n- Lots of bug fixes"
		},
